  "required": [],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "Structura ProgramEmpty. Exemplele sunt sintetice; permisiunile și stările reale se verifică la cerere."
}
```

## Exemple de integrare

Valorile sunt demonstrative. Înlocuiește ID-urile și folosește doar propriile permisiuni.

### JavaScript

```javascript
const response = await fetch("https://openaliment.ro/api/v2/program/me/applications/aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa", {
  method: "DELETE",
  credentials: "same-origin",
  headers: {
  "Accept": "application/json",
  "X-CSRF-Token": "CSRF_FROM_YOUR_OWN_SESSION",
  "Idempotency-Key": "exemplu-programOauthClientRevoke-001",
  "Content-Type": "application/json"
},
  body: JSON.stringify({})
});
const result = await response.json();
if (!response.ok) throw new Error(result.message || result.error_description || ('HTTP ' + response.status));
console.log(result);
```

### cURL

```sh
curl --fail-with-body -X DELETE https://openaliment.ro/api/v2/program/me/applications/aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa \
  -H 'Accept: application/json' \
  -H 'X-CSRF-Token: CSRF_FROM_YOUR_OWN_SESSION' \
  -H 'Idempotency-Key: exemplu-programOauthClientRevoke-001' \
  --cookie "$OPENALIMENT_COOKIE_FILE" \
  --cookie-jar "$OPENALIMENT_COOKIE_FILE" \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  --data '{}'
```

